          p: a.verification(href='https://s3.amazonaws.com/coursera_assets/meta_images/generated/CERTIFICATE_LANDING_PAGE/CERTIFICATE_LANDING_PAGE~BIPV9CMU7DN1/CERTIFICATE_LANDING_PAGE~BIPV9CMU7DN1.jpeg') verification

        li.cert-item
          h3 Data Analysis and Visualization
          small.issuer Microsoft • BZFT0K01BE2M • May 2026
          p Built practical knowledge in data analytics and visualization workflows using Python. Implemented data cleaning, feature analysis, visualization dashboards, and basic ML operations using standard libraries.
          p: a.verification(href='https://s3.amazonaws.com/coursera_assets/meta_images/generated/CERTIFICATE_LANDING_PAGE/CERTIFICATE_LANDING_PAGE~BZFTOK0IBE2M/CERTIFICATE_LANDING_PAGE~BZFTOK0IBE2M.jpeg') verification

        li.cert-item
          h3 Automation and Scripting with Python
          small.issuer Microsoft • OQCP1HE3KDB4 • May 2026
          p Gained hands-on experience in Python automation, scripting, debugging, and process optimization for file operations, web requests, and task scheduling.
