          p: a.verification(href='https://s3.amazonaws.com/coursera_assets/meta_images/generated/CERTIFICATE_LANDING_PAGE/CERTIFICATE_LANDING_PAGE~FPLBH1GS13NZ/CERTIFICATE_LANDING_PAGE~FPLBH1GS13NZ.jpeg') verification

        li.cert-item
          h3 Software Engineering Job Simulation
          small.issuer JPMorganChase
          p Simulation covering microservices, Kafka integration, transaction validation, Spring Data JPA, H2 SQL, REST endpoints, and test-driven inspection. (PDF)
