          h3 Project Development in Python
          small.issuer Microsoft
          p Developed end-to-end Python applications applying modular design, testing, and documentation to create maintainable solutions.
          p: a.verification(href='https://coursera.org/verify/WLC5506RKEMI') verification

      li.cert-item
          h3 Microsoft Python Development
          small.issuer Microsoft
          p Professional certificate
          p: a.verification(href='https://coursera.org/verify/professional-cert/JGIE7MDW7BDJ') verification

